  "AuthFlow": "oauth2-authcode",
  "AuthFlowNote": "Fonteva uses standard Salesforce Connected App OAuth2. restapi.fonteva.io Introduction: ''leverage the core Salesforce REST Api infrastructure to deliver our Api''s. All authentication is done using core Salesforce Auth''. All endpoint examples show ''Authorization: Bearer SESSIONID''. OAuth2 auth-code (web-server) flow and JWT-bearer are both supported; auth-code is the standard interactive flow for human-initiated connections. JWT-bearer (server-to-server) is the alternative for unattended integration. Source: restapi.fonteva.io + Salesforce OAuth2 docs.",
  "AuthFlowAlternate": "oauth2-jwt-bearer",
  "AuthFlowAlternateNote": "Salesforce JWT Bearer token flow (RFC 7523) is available as the server-to-server alternative. No interactive login; connector re-acquires via JWT assertion exchange on expiry.",
  "AuthHeaderPattern": "Authorization: Bearer <access_token>",
  "AuthHeaderPatternNote": "Explicit in restapi.fonteva.io: every REST endpoint example shows ''Authorization: Bearer SESSIONID''. Errors section: 401 = ''Unauthorized -- Your session id is wrong.'' Source: restapi.fonteva.io Introduction section + per-endpoint examples.",
  "InstanceURLNote": "The Salesforce instance URL (e.g. https://myorg.my.salesforce.com) is org-specific and returned in the OAuth token response as ''instance_url''. All /services/apexrest/ and /services/data/ paths are relative to this base. It is NOT a static constant.",
  "TokenEndpoint": "https://{LoginUrl}/services/oauth2/token",
  "TokenRefreshStrategy": "re-acquire-on-expiry",
  "TokenRefreshStrategyNote": "Salesforce access tokens expire (typically 2 hours). For JWT Bearer flow the connector re-acquires via a new JWT assertion exchange. For auth-code flow a refresh_token grant is available. The connector tracks expiry and refreshes before TTL expires. Identical to SalesforceConnector pattern.",
  "FDServiceBasePath": "/services/apexrest/FDService",
  "FDServiceBasePathNote": "Every FDService REST endpoint follows the pattern https://{instanceUrl}/services/apexrest/FDService/<ServiceName>. Explicit in restapi.fonteva.io for all 9 documented services: EPaymentLineMapService, InstallmentScheduleService, ItemPriceService, JournalService, OrderPaymentService, OrderService, RecordMatchService, ScheduledPaymentChargeService, SubscriptionRenewalService. Source: restapi.fonteva.io.",
  "SalesforceDataBasePath": "/services/data/v{version}",
  "SalesforceDataBasePathNote": "The Salesforce platform REST data path used for sObject CRUD, SOQL queries, describe calls, and runtime discovery. Version token is resolved at connection time (e.g. v61.0). Same as SalesforceConnector. Source: Salesforce REST API Developer Guide v67.0 Ch1 URI format.",
  "ManagedPackageNamespaces": [
