  "ManagedPackageNamespacesNote": "The two Fonteva managed packages install custom objects under the ''orderapi__'' and ''eventapi__'' namespace prefixes. The connector''s DiscoverObjects/DiscoverFields filters the Salesforce global describe output to objects whose API name starts with ''OrderApi__'' or ''EventApi__'' (case-insensitive). Source: SOURCE_STUDY.md § Vendor Context — ''OrderApi (namespace orderapi__)'' + ''EventApi (namespace eventapi__)''.",
